    "A careful guide for digging into topics and weighing sources.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein sorgf\u00e4ltiger Begleiter, um Themen zu durchdringen und Quellen abzuw\u00e4gen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e00\u4e2a\u7ec6\u81f4\u7684\u5411\u5bfc\uff0c\u5e2e\u4f60\u6df1\u5165\u63a2\u7a76\u4e3b\u9898\u5e76\u6743\u8861\u8d44\u6599\u6765\u6e90\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A device wants to pair with **%@**.\nAllow this device to connect?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Ger\u00e4t m\u00f6chte sich mit **%@** koppeln.\nDieses Ger\u00e4t verbinden lassen?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6709\u8bbe\u5907\u60f3\u8981\u4e0e **%@** \u914d\u5bf9\u3002\n\u5141\u8bb8\u6b64\u8bbe\u5907\u8fde\u63a5\u5417\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up a dino for each kind of work. It remembers your context, so you stop re-explaining yourself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Richte f\u00fcr jede Art von Arbeit einen Dino ein. Er merkt sich deinen Kontext, sodass du dich nicht st\u00e4ndig wiederholen musst."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e3a\u6bcf\u79cd\u5de5\u4f5c\u8bbe\u7f6e\u4e00\u53ea\u5c0f\u6050\u9f99\u3002\u5b83\u4f1a\u8bb0\u4f4f\u4f60\u7684\u4e0a\u4e0b\u6587\uff0c\u8ba9\u4f60\u4e0d\u5fc5\u53cd\u590d\u89e3\u91ca\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A focused helper for planning, todos, and staying on track.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein fokussierter Helfer f\u00fcrs Planen, To-dos und den \u00dcberblick."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e00\u4e2a\u4e13\u6ce8\u7684\u52a9\u624b\uff0c\u5e2e\u4f60\u89c4\u5212\u3001\u7ba1\u7406\u5f85\u529e\u5e76\u4fdd\u6301\u8282\u594f\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A friendly all-rounder for everyday questions and tasks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein freundliches Allround-Talent f\u00fcr allt\u00e4gliche Fragen und Aufgaben."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e00\u4e2a\u53cb\u597d\u7684\u5168\u80fd\u52a9\u624b\uff0c\u5e94\u5bf9\u65e5\u5e38\u95ee\u9898\u4e0e\u4efb\u52a1\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A microphone button will appear in the chat input when voice is ready": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine Mikrofon-Schaltfl\u00e4che erscheint in der Chat-Eingabe, wenn Stimme bereit ist"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f53\u8bed\u97f3\u51c6\u5907\u597d\u65f6\uff0c\u9ea6\u514b\u98ce\u6309\u94ae\u5c06\u51fa\u73b0\u5728\u804a\u5929\u8f93\u5165\u4e2d"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A pragmatic pair-programmer for reading and writing code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein pragmatischer Pair-Programmer zum Lesen und Schreiben von Code."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e00\u4e2a\u52a1\u5b9e\u7684\u7ed3\u5bf9\u7a0b\u5e8f\u5458\uff0c\u5e2e\u4f60\u8bfb\u5199\u4ee3\u7801\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quick tour": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine kurze Tour"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5feb\u901f\u6d4f\u89c8"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A safety net for your dino": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Sicherheitsnetz f\u00fcr deinen Dino"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e3a\u4f60\u7684\u5c0f\u6050\u9f99\u63d0\u4f9b\u7684\u5b89\u5168\u7f51"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A short code that proves what you make is really yours.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein kurzer Code, der beweist, dass das, was du erstellst, wirklich dir geh\u00f6rt."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e00\u6bb5\u7b80\u77ed\u7684\u4ee3\u7801\uff0c\u7528\u4e8e\u8bc1\u660e\u4f60\u521b\u5efa\u7684\u5185\u5bb9\u786e\u5b9e\u5c5e\u4e8e\u4f60\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A short code that proves what you make is really yours. We back it up in iCloud Keychain so it follows you across your Apple devices.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein kurzer Code, der beweist, dass das, was du erstellst, wirklich dir geh\u00f6rt. Wir sichern ihn im iCloud-Schl\u00fcsselbund, damit er dich \u00fcber deine Apple-Ger\u00e4te hinweg begleitet."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e00\u6bb5\u7b80\u77ed\u7684\u4ee3\u7801\uff0c\u7528\u4e8e\u8bc1\u660e\u4f60\u521b\u5efa\u7684\u5185\u5bb9\u786e\u5b9e\u5c5e\u4e8e\u4f60\u3002\u6211\u4eec\u4f1a\u5c06\u5176\u5907\u4efd\u5230 iCloud \u94a5\u5319\u4e32\u4e2d\uff0c\u4ee5\u4fbf\u5b83\u5728\u4f60\u7684\u5404\u53f0 Apple \u8bbe\u5907\u95f4\u540c\u6b65\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A stalled provider or dropped connection can hang a request indefinitely. You'll have to stop it manually": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein h\u00e4ngender Anbieter oder eine abgebrochene Verbindung kann eine Anfrage unbegrenzt blockieren. Du musst sie manuell stoppen"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u505c\u6ede\u7684\u63d0\u4f9b\u65b9\u6216\u65ad\u5f00\u7684\u8fde\u63a5\u53ef\u80fd\u4f7f\u8bf7\u6c42\u65e0\u9650\u671f\u6302\u8d77\u3002\u4f60\u9700\u8981\u624b\u52a8\u505c\u6b62\u5b83"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A thoughtful partner for drafting, editing, and polishing prose.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein einf\u00fchlsamer Partner zum Entwerfen, \u00dcberarbeiten und Verfeinern von Texten."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e00\u4e2a\u4f53\u8d34\u7684\u4f19\u4f34\uff0c\u5e2e\u4f60\u8d77\u8349\u3001\u7f16\u8f91\u5e76\u6da6\u8272\u6587\u5b57\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About 2.8 GB. The detection model runs entirely on your Mac \u2014 no third-party traffic for detection.": {
      "comment": "Footnote text in the PrivacyInstallHero, describing the size and privacy of the model.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Etwa 2,8 GB. Das Erkennungsmodell l\u00e4uft vollst\u00e4ndig auf deinem Mac \u2013 kein Drittanbieter-Datenverkehr f\u00fcr die Erkennung."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7ea6 2.8 GB\u3002\u68c0\u6d4b\u6a21\u578b\u5b8c\u5168\u5728\u4f60\u7684 Mac \u4e0a\u8fd0\u884c\u2014\u2014\u68c0\u6d4b\u8fc7\u7a0b\u6ca1\u6709\u4efb\u4f55\u7b2c\u4e09\u65b9\u6d41\u91cf\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About encrypted storage": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u00dcber verschl\u00fcsselten Speicher"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5173\u4e8e\u52a0\u5bc6\u5b58\u50a8"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About System Permissions": {
      "localizations": {
