          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Advertise this agent on your local network via Bonjour so nearby devices can discover it automatically.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mache diesen Agenten \u00fcber Bonjour in deinem lokalen Netzwerk bekannt, damit Ger\u00e4te in der N\u00e4he ihn automatisch finden k\u00f6nnen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u901a\u8fc7 Bonjour \u5728\u672c\u5730\u7f51\u7edc\u4e2d\u516c\u5e03\u6b64\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\uff0c\u4ee5\u4fbf\u9644\u8fd1\u7684\u8bbe\u5907\u53ef\u4ee5\u81ea\u52a8\u53d1\u73b0\u5b83\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Affects pause detection, wake word detection, and voice activity thresholds": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beeinflusst Pausenerkennung, Aktivierungswort-Erkennung und Sprachaktivit\u00e4tsschwellen"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f71\u54cd\u6682\u505c\u68c0\u6d4b\u3001\u5524\u9192\u8bcd\u68c0\u6d4b\u548c\u8bed\u97f3\u6d3b\u52a8\u9608\u503c"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After each chat, the agent distills the conversation into a short summary. Episodes accumulate here so the agent can recall past sessions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nach jedem Chat verdichtet der Agent das Gespr\u00e4ch zu einer kurzen Zusammenfassung. Episoden sammeln sich hier an, sodass der Agent vergangene Sitzungen abrufen kann."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6bcf\u6b21\u804a\u5929\u540e\uff0c\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u4f1a\u5c06\u5bf9\u8bdd\u63d0\u70bc\u6210\u7b80\u77ed\u7684\u6458\u8981\u3002\u60c5\u8282\u4f1a\u5728\u6b64\u7d2f\u79ef\uff0c\u4ee5\u4fbf\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u56de\u5fc6\u8d77\u8fc7\u53bb\u7684\u4f1a\u8bdd\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agent": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
