    "Ask for something real. It uses the web, your files, and your apps to finish the job, then double-checks before answering.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bitte um etwas Konkretes. Es nutzt das Web, deine Dateien und deine Apps, um die Aufgabe zu erledigen, und pr\u00fcft alles noch einmal, bevor es antwortet."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u63d0\u51fa\u4e00\u4e2a\u771f\u5b9e\u7684\u4efb\u52a1\u3002\u5b83\u4f1a\u4f7f\u7528\u7f51\u7edc\u3001\u4f60\u7684\u6587\u4ef6\u548c\u4f60\u7684\u5e94\u7528\u6765\u5b8c\u6210\u5de5\u4f5c\uff0c\u5e76\u5728\u56de\u7b54\u524d\u518d\u6b21\u6838\u5bf9\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask the agent in chat to remember something \u2014 it will call `db_create_table` to build the schema it needs. You can browse what it creates here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bitte den Agenten im Chat, sich etwas zu merken \u2013 er ruft `db_create_table` auf, um das ben\u00f6tigte Schema zu erstellen. Hier kannst du durchsehen, was er anlegt."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5728\u804a\u5929\u4e2d\u8bf7\u6c42\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u8bb0\u4f4f\u67d0\u4e9b\u5185\u5bb9\u2014\u2014\u5b83\u4f1a\u8c03\u7528 `db_create_table` \u6765\u6784\u5efa\u6240\u9700\u7684\u67b6\u6784\u3002\u4f60\u53ef\u4ee5\u5728\u6b64\u67e5\u770b\u5b83\u521b\u5efa\u7684\u5185\u5bb9\u3002"
