    "Built-in deterministic detectors run alongside the on-device model. Turning a category off stops Osaurus from flagging it AND from blocking sends when it leaks past redaction.": {
      "comment": "A description of the built-in detection patterns, emphasizing that turning them off will prevent both false positives and false negatives.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Integrierte deterministische Detektoren laufen parallel zum Modell auf dem Ger\u00e4t. Wird eine Kategorie deaktiviert, markiert Osaurus sie nicht mehr UND blockiert das Senden nicht mehr, wenn sie an der Schw\u00e4rzung vorbei durchsickert."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5185\u7f6e\u7684\u786e\u5b9a\u6027\u68c0\u6d4b\u5668\u4e0e\u8bbe\u5907\u7aef\u6a21\u578b\u4e00\u540c\u8fd0\u884c\u3002\u5173\u95ed\u67d0\u4e2a\u7c7b\u522b\u540e\uff0cOsaurus \u5c06\u4e0d\u518d\u6807\u8bb0\u5b83\uff0c\u4e5f\u4e0d\u518d\u5728\u5176\u7ed5\u8fc7\u8131\u654f\u6cc4\u9732\u65f6\u963b\u6b62\u53d1\u9001\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Built-in sandbox execution tools and JSON-defined plugin tools that run inside the sandbox container.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Built-in sandbox execution tools and JSON-defined plugin tools that run inside the sandbox container."
