    "Define your own regex patterns \u2014 internal codenames, customer IDs, anything Osaurus's built-ins don't cover. Bad patterns are validated before save.": {
      "comment": "A description under the \"Custom Rules\" section, explaining that users can create their own regex patterns to identify sensitive information.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Definiere deine eigenen Regex-Muster \u2013 interne Codenamen, Kunden-IDs, alles, was die integrierten Muster von Osaurus nicht abdecken. Fehlerhafte Muster werden vor dem Speichern validiert."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5b9a\u4e49\u4f60\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u6b63\u5219\u8868\u8fbe\u5f0f\u6a21\u5f0f\u2014\u2014\u5185\u90e8\u4ee3\u53f7\u3001\u5ba2\u6237 ID \u7b49\u4efb\u4f55 Osaurus \u5185\u7f6e\u89c4\u5219\u672a\u8986\u76d6\u7684\u5185\u5bb9\u3002\u9519\u8bef\u7684\u6a21\u5f0f\u4f1a\u5728\u4fdd\u5b58\u524d\u8fdb\u884c\u6821\u9a8c\u3002"
