    "Detects PII in your messages and asks you to review before any cloud-bound request. Local models (MLX, Foundation) and on-device tools bypass the filter.": {
      "comment": "Description for the master Privacy Filter toggle.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erkennt personenbezogene Daten in deinen Nachrichten und bittet dich um \u00dcberpr\u00fcfung vor jeder an die Cloud gerichteten Anfrage. Lokale Modelle (MLX, Foundation) und Tools auf dem Ger\u00e4t umgehen den Filter."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u68c0\u6d4b\u4f60\u6d88\u606f\u4e2d\u7684\u4e2a\u4eba\u8eab\u4efd\u4fe1\u606f\uff08PII\uff09\uff0c\u5e76\u5728\u4efb\u4f55\u53d1\u5f80\u4e91\u7aef\u7684\u8bf7\u6c42\u524d\u8bf7\u4f60\u8fdb\u884c\u5ba1\u6838\u3002\u672c\u5730\u6a21\u578b\uff08MLX\u3001Foundation\uff09\u548c\u8bbe\u5907\u7aef\u5de5\u5177\u4f1a\u7ed5\u8fc7\u6b64\u8fc7\u6ee4\u5668\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
