    "Give the agent a tool it can call to read a reply aloud when you ask. For always-speak, use Auto Speak Responses in the Voice section.": {
      "comment": "A description of a feature toggle that lets an agent read its responses aloud.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Give the agent a tool it can call to read a reply aloud when you ask. For always-speak, use Auto Speak Responses in the Voice section."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f53\u60a8\u63d0\u95ee\u65f6\uff0c\u7ed9\u4ee3\u7406\u4e00\u4e2a\u5b83\u53ef\u4ee5\u8c03\u7528\u7684\u5de5\u5177\u6765\u6717\u8bfb\u56de\u590d\u3002\u5982\u9700\u59cb\u7ec8\u6717\u8bfb\uff0c\u8bf7\u5728\u8bed\u97f3\u90e8\u5206\u4f7f\u7528\u201c\u81ea\u52a8\u6717\u8bfb\u56de\u590d\u201d\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Give this agent a private encrypted database to remember structured data across runs.": {
      "comment": "A description of the \"Database\" feature toggle in the Agent Detail View.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gib diesem Agenten eine private verschl\u00fcsselte Datenbank, um strukturierte Daten \u00fcber L\u00e4ufe hinweg zu speichern."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e3a\u6b64\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u63d0\u4f9b\u4e00\u4e2a\u79c1\u6709\u7684\u52a0\u5bc6\u6570\u636e\u5e93\uff0c\u4ee5\u4fbf\u8de8\u591a\u6b21\u8fd0\u884c\u8bb0\u4f4f\u7ed3\u6784\u5316\u6570\u636e\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Give your dino a brain": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gib deinem Dino ein Gehirn"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7ed9\u4f60\u7684\u5c0f\u6050\u9f99\u4e00\u4e2a\u5927\u8111"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glass effects use behind-window blur and additional compositing layers. This may impact performance, especially on older Macs or under heavy load.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glaseffekte verwenden eine Unsch\u00e4rfe hinter dem Fenster und zus\u00e4tzliche Compositing-Ebenen. Dies kann die Leistung beeintr\u00e4chtigen, insbesondere auf \u00e4lteren Macs oder bei hoher Last."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
