        }
      }
    },
    "Inherits from the global personality in Settings \u2192 Chat. Edit to give this agent its own voice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erbt von der globalen Pers\u00f6nlichkeit unter Einstellungen \u2192 Chat. Bearbeite es, um diesem Agenten eine eigene Stimme zu geben."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7ee7\u627f\u81ea\u201c\u8bbe\u7f6e \u2192 \u804a\u5929\u201d\u4e2d\u7684\u5168\u5c40\u4e2a\u6027\u3002\u53ef\u7f16\u8f91\u4ee5\u8d4b\u4e88\u6b64\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u72ec\u6709\u7684\u98ce\u683c\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Initial": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anf\u00e4nglich"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u9996\u5b57\u6bcd"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inject persistent memory (identity, pinned facts, episodes) into the chat. A relevance gate decides whether memory is needed per-turn, with a single ~800 token budget when it is. Enable for agents that benefit from long-term context.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "F\u00fcge dem Chat dauerhaften Speicher (Identit\u00e4t, angeheftete Fakten, Episoden) hinzu. Ein Relevanz-Gate entscheidet pro Runde, ob Speicher ben\u00f6tigt wird, mit einem einzigen Budget von ~800 Tokens, wenn dies der Fall ist. Aktiviere dies f\u00fcr Agenten, die von langfristigem Kontext profitieren."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5c06\u6301\u4e45\u5316\u8bb0\u5fc6\uff08\u8eab\u4efd\u3001\u56fa\u5b9a\u4e8b\u5b9e\u3001\u60c5\u8282\uff09\u6ce8\u5165\u804a\u5929\u3002\u76f8\u5173\u6027\u95e8\u63a7\u4f1a\u9010\u8f6e\u5224\u65ad\u662f\u5426\u9700\u8981\u8bb0\u5fc6\uff0c\u9700\u8981\u65f6\u4f7f\u7528\u7ea6 800 \u4e2a token \u7684\u5355\u6b21\u9884\u7b97\u3002\u5bf9\u4e8e\u53d7\u76ca\u4e8e\u957f\u671f\u4e0a\u4e0b\u6587\u7684\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\uff0c\u8bf7\u542f\u7528\u6b64\u9879\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inline plugin inference \u2014 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inline-Plugin-Inferenz \u2013 %@"
