            "value": "\u53d1\u73b0\u65e7\u7248 WhisperKit \u6a21\u578b"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let agents use built-in and plugin tools. Turn off to send messages directly to the model with no tool specs or capability injection (chat-only).": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Let agents use built-in and plugin tools. Turn off to send messages directly to the model with no tool specs or capability injection (chat-only)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5141\u8bb8\u4ee3\u7406\u4f7f\u7528\u5185\u7f6e\u5de5\u5177\u548c\u63d2\u4ef6\u5de5\u5177\u3002\u5173\u95ed\u6b64\u9009\u9879\uff0c\u5219\u6d88\u606f\u5c06\u76f4\u63a5\u53d1\u9001\u7ed9\u6a21\u578b\uff0c\u4e0d\u9644\u5e26\u4efb\u4f55\u5de5\u5177\u89c4\u683c\u6216\u80fd\u529b\u6ce8\u5165\uff08\u7eaf\u804a\u5929\u6a21\u5f0f\uff09\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let requests run with no time limit": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anfragen ohne Zeitlimit ausf\u00fchren"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8ba9\u8bf7\u6c42\u5728\u65e0\u65f6\u95f4\u9650\u5236\u4e0b\u8fd0\u884c"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let the agent act between your messages.": {
      "comment": "Feature toggle row title for \"Self-scheduling\" feature.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lass den Agenten zwischen deinen Nachrichten handeln."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8ba9\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u5728\u4f60\u7684\u6d88\u606f\u4e4b\u95f4\u91c7\u53d6\u884c\u52a8\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let the agent create its own tools as plugins.": {
      "comment": "A feature toggle that lets an agent create its own tools as plugins.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lass den Agenten eigene Tools als Plugins erstellen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8ba9\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u4ee5\u63d2\u4ef6\u5f62\u5f0f\u521b\u5efa\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u5de5\u5177\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let the agent run long-lived processes (servers, watchers) detached and manage them. Off by default to keep the tool surface lean.": {
      "comment": "A description for the \"Background Processes\" feature in the Agent Detail View.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Let the agent run long-lived processes (servers, watchers) detached and manage them. Off by default to keep the tool surface lean."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8ba9\u4ee3\u7406\u4ee5\u5206\u79bb\u7684\u65b9\u5f0f\u8fd0\u884c\u957f\u671f\u8fdb\u7a0b\uff08\u670d\u52a1\u5668\u3001\u76d1\u89c6\u5668\uff09\u5e76\u7ba1\u7406\u5b83\u4eec\u3002\u9ed8\u8ba4\u5173\u95ed\u4ee5\u4fdd\u6301\u5de5\u5177\u754c\u9762\u7b80\u6d01\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let the agent schedule its own follow-up runs and send you notifications.": {
      "comment": "A description of the \"Self-scheduling\" feature in the Agent Detail View.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Let the agent schedule its own follow-up runs and send you notifications."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8ba9\u4ee3\u7406\u81ea\u884c\u5b89\u6392\u540e\u7eed\u8fd0\u884c\u5e76\u901a\u77e5\u60a8\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let the agent schedule its own follow-up runs and send you notifications. Turn on to choose how often it can run.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lass den Agenten eigene Folgel\u00e4ufe planen und dir Benachrichtigungen senden. Aktiviere dies, um festzulegen, wie oft er laufen darf."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8ba9\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u81ea\u884c\u5b89\u6392\u540e\u7eed\u8fd0\u884c\u5e76\u5411\u4f60\u53d1\u9001\u901a\u77e5\u3002\u5f00\u542f\u540e\u53ef\u9009\u62e9\u5b83\u7684\u8fd0\u884c\u9891\u7387\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let the agent search its own memory mid-conversation to pull up past details on demand. Separate from Memory above, which only auto-injects and saves.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lass den Agenten w\u00e4hrend des Gespr\u00e4chs seinen eigenen Speicher durchsuchen, um bei Bedarf vergangene Details abzurufen. Getrennt von \u201eSpeicher\u201c oben, der nur automatisch einf\u00fcgt und speichert."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8ba9\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u5728\u5bf9\u8bdd\u8fc7\u7a0b\u4e2d\u641c\u7d22\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u8bb0\u5fc6\uff0c\u6309\u9700\u8c03\u53d6\u8fc7\u53bb\u7684\u7ec6\u8282\u3002\u8fd9\u4e0e\u4e0a\u65b9\u7684\u201c\u8bb0\u5fc6\u201d\u4e0d\u540c\uff0c\u540e\u8005\u4ec5\u81ea\u52a8\u6ce8\u5165\u548c\u4fdd\u5b58\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let the agent use tools to take actions and look things up. Turn off for a chat-only agent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lass den Agenten Tools verwenden, um Aktionen auszuf\u00fchren und Dinge nachzuschlagen. Deaktiviere dies f\u00fcr einen reinen Chat-Agenten."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8ba9\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u4f7f\u7528\u5de5\u5177\u6765\u6267\u884c\u64cd\u4f5c\u548c\u67e5\u627e\u4fe1\u606f\u3002\u5982\u9700\u4ec5\u804a\u5929\u7684\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\uff0c\u8bf7\u5173\u95ed\u6b64\u9879\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let the model invoke tools without an explicit `tool_choice` from the client.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Let the model invoke tools without an explicit `tool_choice` from the client."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5141\u8bb8\u6a21\u578b\u5728\u5ba2\u6237\u7aef\u672a\u663e\u5f0f\u6307\u5b9a `tool_choice` \u65f6\u8c03\u7528\u5de5\u5177\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let the server release memory when no requests are in flight.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Let the server release memory when no requests are in flight."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5141\u8bb8\u670d\u52a1\u5668\u5728\u6ca1\u6709\u6b63\u5728\u5904\u7406\u7684\u8bf7\u6c42\u65f6\u91ca\u653e\u5185\u5b58\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let tools in without sharing your password": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tools zulassen, ohne dein Passwort preiszugeben"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5728\u4e0d\u5171\u4eab\u5bc6\u7801\u7684\u60c5\u51b5\u4e0b\u5141\u8bb8\u5de5\u5177\u63a5\u5165"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets your dino install packages, run scripts, and work with files like a real machine.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L\u00e4sst deinen Dino Pakete installieren, Skripte ausf\u00fchren und mit Dateien arbeiten wie ein echter Computer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8ba9\u4f60\u7684\u5c0f\u6050\u9f99\u50cf\u4e00\u53f0\u771f\u6b63\u7684\u673a\u5668\u4e00\u6837\u5b89\u88c5\u8f6f\u4ef6\u5305\u3001\u8fd0\u884c\u811a\u672c\u5e76\u5904\u7406\u6587\u4ef6\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
