    "Local brains live on your Mac. They use a chunk of memory while running, and they keep working offline.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lokale Gehirne leben auf deinem Mac. Sie belegen w\u00e4hrend der Ausf\u00fchrung einen Teil des Speichers und funktionieren weiterhin offline."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u672c\u5730\u5927\u8111\u4fdd\u5b58\u5728\u4f60\u7684 Mac \u4e0a\u3002\u5b83\u4eec\u8fd0\u884c\u65f6\u4f1a\u5360\u7528\u4e00\u90e8\u5206\u5185\u5b58\uff0c\u5e76\u4e14\u53ef\u4ee5\u79bb\u7ebf\u5de5\u4f5c\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local endpoints don't usually need a key \u2014 leave blank to skip auth.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lokale Endpunkte ben\u00f6tigen normalerweise keinen Schl\u00fcssel \u2013 leer lassen, um die Authentifizierung zu \u00fcberspringen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u672c\u5730\u7aef\u70b9\u901a\u5e38\u4e0d\u9700\u8981\u5bc6\u94a5\u2014\u2014\u7559\u7a7a\u5373\u53ef\u8df3\u8fc7\u8eab\u4efd\u9a8c\u8bc1\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local Guide": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lokaler Guide"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f53\u5730\u5bfc\u6e38"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local models are compute-intensive and our curated picks need more unified memory than this machine has. We recommend a different path.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lokale Modelle sind rechenintensiv, und unsere kuratierten Auswahlen ben\u00f6tigen mehr Unified Memory, als dieser Computer hat. Wir empfehlen einen anderen Weg."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u672c\u5730\u6a21\u578b\u8ba1\u7b97\u91cf\u5927\uff0c\u6211\u4eec\u7cbe\u9009\u7684\u6a21\u578b\u6240\u9700\u7684\u7edf\u4e00\u5185\u5b58\u8d85\u8fc7\u4e86\u672c\u673a\u7684\u5bb9\u91cf\u3002\u6211\u4eec\u5efa\u8bae\u9009\u62e9\u5176\u4ed6\u65b9\u6848\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
