    "Manage keys in the Server \u2192 Overview tab. They are stored in the macOS Keychain and never leave this device.": {
      "comment": "A description of how to manage API access keys.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verwalte Schl\u00fcssel im Tab Server \u2192 \u00dcbersicht. Sie werden im macOS-Schl\u00fcsselbund gespeichert und verlassen dieses Ger\u00e4t niemals."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5728\u201c\u670d\u52a1\u5668 \u2192 \u6982\u89c8\u201d\u6807\u7b7e\u9875\u4e2d\u7ba1\u7406\u5bc6\u94a5\u3002\u5b83\u4eec\u5b58\u50a8\u5728 macOS \u94a5\u5319\u4e32\u4e2d\uff0c\u7edd\u4e0d\u4f1a\u79bb\u5f00\u6b64\u8bbe\u5907\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
