          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aus"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79bb\u5f00"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off binds to 127.0.0.1 (this Mac only). On binds to 0.0.0.0 so phones, iPads, and other devices on your network can connect.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Off binds to 127.0.0.1 (this Mac only). On binds to 0.0.0.0 so phones, iPads, and other devices on your network can connect."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5173\u95ed\u5219\u4ec5\u7ed1\u5b9a\u5230127.0.0.1\uff08\u4ec5\u6b64Mac\uff09\u3002\u5f00\u542f\u5219\u7ed1\u5b9a\u52300.0.0.0\uff0c\u8fd9\u6837\u624b\u673a\u3001iPad\u548c\u5176\u4ed6\u7f51\u7edc\u8bbe\u5907\u5c31\u53ef\u4ee5\u8fde\u63a5\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default. When on, each empty state generates a fresh greeting + quick actions on the configured Core Model. The first generation can feel slow on small models like Foundation; the static greeting still paints instantly. Per-agent overrides in the Customization tab still win.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Standardm\u00e4\u00dfig deaktiviert. Wenn aktiviert, erzeugt jeder Leerzustand eine neue Begr\u00fc\u00dfung + Schnellaktionen auf dem konfigurierten Core-Modell. Die erste Generierung kann sich bei kleinen Modellen wie Foundation langsam anf\u00fchlen; die statische Begr\u00fc\u00dfung wird trotzdem sofort angezeigt. Pro-Agent-Overrides im Tab \u201eAnpassung\u201c haben weiterhin Vorrang."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u9ed8\u8ba4\u5173\u95ed\u3002\u5f00\u542f\u540e\uff0c\u6bcf\u4e2a\u7a7a\u767d\u72b6\u6001\u90fd\u4f1a\u5728\u914d\u7f6e\u7684\u6838\u5fc3\u6a21\u578b\u4e0a\u751f\u6210\u5168\u65b0\u7684\u95ee\u5019\u8bed\u548c\u5feb\u6377\u64cd\u4f5c\u3002\u5728 Foundation \u7b49\u5c0f\u578b\u6a21\u578b\u4e0a\uff0c\u9996\u6b21\u751f\u6210\u53ef\u80fd\u4f1a\u611f\u89c9\u8f83\u6162\uff1b\u9759\u6001\u95ee\u5019\u8bed\u4ecd\u4f1a\u7acb\u5373\u663e\u793a\u3002\u201c\u81ea\u5b9a\u4e49\u201d\u6807\u7b7e\u9875\u4e2d\u7684\u6309\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u8986\u76d6\u9879\u4ecd\u7136\u4f18\u5148\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off disables speculation. Auto uses it only when the model ships a verified native MTP head. Force-On requires that head.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Off disables speculation. Auto uses it only when the model ships a verified native MTP head. Force-On requires that head."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off \u4f1a\u7981\u7528\u63a8\u6d4b\u89e3\u7801\u3002Auto \u4ec5\u5728\u6a21\u578b\u81ea\u5e26\u7ecf\u9a8c\u8bc1\u7684\u539f\u751f MTP \u5934\u65f6\u4f7f\u7528\u3002Force-On \u8981\u6c42\u8be5\u5934\u5b58\u5728\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off: access expires in 90 days. On: access never expires until revoked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aus: Zugriff l\u00e4uft in 90 Tagen ab. An: Zugriff l\u00e4uft nie ab, bis er widerrufen wird."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
