    "Osaurus supports MLX-compatible Hugging Face repositories, including MLX, MXFP, JANG, JANGTQ, and TurboQuant artifacts when required files are present.": {
      "comment": "Informative text in an alert displayed when a user tries to open a model in Osaurus that is not MLX-compatible.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Osaurus unterst\u00fctzt MLX-kompatible Hugging-Face-Repositories, einschlie\u00dflich MLX-, MXFP-, JANG-, JANGTQ- und TurboQuant-Artefakten, sofern die erforderlichen Dateien vorhanden sind."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Osaurus \u652f\u6301\u517c\u5bb9 MLX \u7684 Hugging Face \u4ed3\u5e93\uff0c\u5305\u62ec\u5728\u5177\u5907\u6240\u9700\u6587\u4ef6\u65f6\u7684 MLX\u3001MXFP\u3001JANG\u3001JANGTQ \u548c TurboQuant \u5de5\u4ef6\u3002"
