    "Paste the 24-word recovery phrase you saved during onboarding. We'll restore the original master key and your existing agents and access keys will start working again.": {
      "comment": "A description of the purpose of the recovery phrase field.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "F\u00fcge die 24-W\u00f6rter-Wiederherstellungsphrase ein, die du beim Onboarding gespeichert hast. Wir stellen den urspr\u00fcnglichen Hauptschl\u00fcssel wieder her, und deine vorhandenen Agenten und Zugriffsschl\u00fcssel funktionieren wieder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7c98\u8d34\u4f60\u5728\u521d\u59cb\u8bbe\u7f6e\u65f6\u4fdd\u5b58\u7684 24 \u4e2a\u8bcd\u6062\u590d\u52a9\u8bb0\u8bcd\u3002\u6211\u4eec\u5c06\u6062\u590d\u539f\u59cb\u4e3b\u5bc6\u94a5\uff0c\u4f60\u73b0\u6709\u7684\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u548c\u8bbf\u95ee\u5bc6\u94a5\u5c06\u91cd\u65b0\u5f00\u59cb\u5de5\u4f5c\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
