    "Repair will derive fresh addresses for %lld agent(s) and revoke %lld stale access key(s) under the current master. Existing pairings and clients holding those keys will stop working until they're re-issued.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Reparatur leitet unter dem aktuellen Hauptschl\u00fcssel neue Adressen f\u00fcr %1$lld Agent(en) ab und widerruft %2$lld veraltete(n) Zugriffsschl\u00fcssel. Bestehende Kopplungen und Clients, die diese Schl\u00fcssel besitzen, funktionieren nicht mehr, bis sie neu ausgestellt werden."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Repair will derive fresh addresses for %1$lld agent(s) and revoke %2$lld stale access key(s) under the current master. Existing pairings and clients holding those keys will stop working until they're re-issued."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4fee\u590d\u5c06\u5728\u5f53\u524d\u4e3b\u5bc6\u94a5\u4e0b\u4e3a %1$lld \u4e2a\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u6d3e\u751f\u65b0\u5730\u5740\uff0c\u5e76\u64a4\u9500 %2$lld \u4e2a\u8fc7\u671f\u7684\u8bbf\u95ee\u5bc6\u94a5\u3002\u6301\u6709\u8fd9\u4e9b\u5bc6\u94a5\u7684\u73b0\u6709\u914d\u5bf9\u548c\u5ba2\u6237\u7aef\u5c06\u505c\u6b62\u5de5\u4f5c\uff0c\u76f4\u81f3\u91cd\u65b0\u7b7e\u53d1\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
