    "That doesn't look like a Hugging Face repo. Use the format org/repo or paste a huggingface.co URL.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das sieht nicht wie ein Hugging-Face-Repo aus. Verwende das Format org/repo oder f\u00fcge eine huggingface.co-URL ein."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8fd9\u770b\u8d77\u6765\u4e0d\u50cf\u662f Hugging Face \u4ed3\u5e93\u3002\u8bf7\u4f7f\u7528 org/repo \u683c\u5f0f\uff0c\u6216\u7c98\u8d34\u4e00\u4e2a huggingface.co URL\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That OsaurusAI model isn't in the registry. Pick one from the Recommended list.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses OsaurusAI-Modell ist nicht in der Registry. W\u00e4hle eines aus der Liste \u201eEmpfohlen\u201c."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8be5 OsaurusAI \u6a21\u578b\u4e0d\u5728\u6ce8\u518c\u8868\u4e2d\u3002\u8bf7\u4ece\u201c\u63a8\u8350\u201d\u5217\u8868\u4e2d\u9009\u62e9\u4e00\u4e2a\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The 256-bit encryption key lives in your macOS Keychain. It never leaves this Mac and is not synced to iCloud.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "The 256-bit encryption key lives in your macOS Keychain. It never leaves this Mac and is not synced to iCloud."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "256\u4f4d\u52a0\u5bc6\u5bc6\u94a5\u5b58\u50a8\u5728\u60a8\u7684macOS\u94a5\u5319\u4e32\u4e2d\u3002\u5b83\u6c38\u8fdc\u4e0d\u4f1a\u79bb\u5f00\u8fd9\u53f0Mac\uff0c\u5e76\u4e14\u4e0d\u4f1a\u540c\u6b65\u5230iCloud\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent adds rows with `db_insert` / `db_upsert` when it has something to remember. You can also ask it directly in chat.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Agent f\u00fcgt mit `db_insert` / `db_upsert` Zeilen hinzu, wenn er sich etwas merken m\u00f6chte. Du kannst ihn auch direkt im Chat fragen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f53\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u6709\u9700\u8981\u8bb0\u4f4f\u7684\u5185\u5bb9\u65f6\uff0c\u4f1a\u4f7f\u7528 `db_insert` / `db_upsert` \u6dfb\u52a0\u884c\u3002\u4f60\u4e5f\u53ef\u4ee5\u5728\u804a\u5929\u4e2d\u76f4\u63a5\u8bf7\u6c42\u5b83\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent determines the AI's behavior and available tools.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Agent bestimmt das Verhalten der KI und die verf\u00fcgbaren Tools."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4ee3\u7406\u51b3\u5b9a\u4eba\u5de5\u667a\u80fd\u7684\u884c\u4e3a\u548c\u53ef\u7528\u5de5\u5177\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent will schedule itself when it has work to do.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Agent plant sich selbst, wenn er etwas zu tun hat."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f53\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u6709\u5de5\u4f5c\u8981\u505a\u65f6\uff0c\u5b83\u4f1a\u81ea\u884c\u5b89\u6392\u8ba1\u5212\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI will be triggered when files in this folder change.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die KI wird ausgel\u00f6st, wenn sich Dateien in diesem Ordner \u00e4ndern."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f53\u8be5\u6587\u4ef6\u5939\u4e2d\u7684\u6587\u4ef6\u53d1\u751f\u53d8\u5316\u65f6\uff0cAI\u5c06\u4f1a\u88ab\u89e6\u53d1\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI will receive these instructions along with a list of changed files.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die KI erh\u00e4lt diese Anweisungen zusammen mit einer Liste der ge\u00e4nderten Dateien."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI \u5c06\u6536\u5230\u8fd9\u4e9b\u6307\u4ee4\u4ee5\u53ca\u4e00\u4efd\u5df2\u66f4\u6539\u6587\u4ef6\u7684\u5217\u8868\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI will use this folder as its working directory.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die KI wird diesen Ordner als Arbeitsverzeichnis verwenden."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI \u5c06\u4f7f\u7528\u8be5\u6587\u4ef6\u5939\u4f5c\u4e3a\u5176\u5de5\u4f5c\u76ee\u5f55\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The container's /workspace directory is bind-mounted from ~/.osaurus/container/workspace/. Open it in Finder to browse or edit files directly on the host.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das /workspace-Verzeichnis des Containers wird per Bind-Mount aus ~/.osaurus/container/workspace/ eingebunden. \u00d6ffne es im Finder, um Dateien direkt auf dem Host zu durchsuchen oder zu bearbeiten."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5bb9\u5668\u7684 /workspace \u76ee\u5f55\u901a\u8fc7\u7ed1\u5b9a\u6302\u8f7d\u65b9\u5f0f\u6765\u81ea ~/.osaurus/container/workspace/\u3002\u5728\u8bbf\u8fbe\u4e2d\u6253\u5f00\u5b83\uff0c\u53ef\u76f4\u63a5\u5728\u4e3b\u673a\u4e0a\u6d4f\u89c8\u6216\u7f16\u8f91\u6587\u4ef6\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current model is text-only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das aktuelle Modell ist nur f\u00fcr Text."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The current model is text-only."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f53\u524d\u6a21\u578b\u4ec5\u652f\u6301\u6587\u672c\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current model supports %@ only.": {
      "comment": "Auto-extracted format-string key (Apple String.LocalizationValue canonical form).",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das aktuelle Modell unterst\u00fctzt nur %@."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The current model supports %@ only."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f53\u524d\u6a21\u578b\u4ec5\u652f\u6301 %@\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model is large; keep this window open while it downloads.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Modell ist gro\u00df; lass dieses Fenster ge\u00f6ffnet, w\u00e4hrend es heruntergeladen wird."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8be5\u6a21\u578b\u8f83\u5927\uff1b\u4e0b\u8f7d\u671f\u95f4\u8bf7\u4fdd\u6301\u6b64\u7a97\u53e3\u6253\u5f00\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The plugin's `osr_host_api` mirror struct does not match the host's v6 layout \u2014 most often the v5 `log_structured` slot is skipped, which shifts every later slot by 8 bytes. The plugin then dispatches `host->free_string` to the wrong host trampoline and `libc free()` aborts on a non-malloc pointer, killing the host. See `docs/plugins/HOST_API.md \u2192 Mirror Struct Audit` and `docs/plugins/ABI_VERSIONS.md` for the pinned offsets and the documented v1..v6 evolution.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die `osr_host_api`-Mirror-Struktur des Plugins stimmt nicht mit dem v6-Layout des Hosts \u00fcberein \u2013 meist wird der v5-`log_structured`-Slot \u00fcbersprungen, wodurch sich jeder sp\u00e4tere Slot um 8 Bytes verschiebt. Das Plugin leitet dann `host->free_string` an das falsche Host-Trampolin weiter, und `libc free()` bricht bei einem Nicht-malloc-Zeiger ab und beendet den Host. Siehe `docs/plugins/HOST_API.md \u2192 Mirror Struct Audit` und `docs/plugins/ABI_VERSIONS.md` f\u00fcr die festgelegten Offsets und die dokumentierte v1..v6-Entwicklung."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u63d2\u4ef6\u7684 `osr_host_api` \u955c\u50cf\u7ed3\u6784\u4f53\u4e0e\u4e3b\u673a\u7684 v6 \u5e03\u5c40\u4e0d\u5339\u914d\u2014\u2014\u6700\u5e38\u89c1\u7684\u662f\u8df3\u8fc7\u4e86 v5 \u7684 `log_structured` \u69fd\u4f4d\uff0c\u5bfc\u81f4\u4e4b\u540e\u7684\u6bcf\u4e2a\u69fd\u4f4d\u90fd\u504f\u79fb\u4e86 8 \u4e2a\u5b57\u8282\u3002\u968f\u540e\u63d2\u4ef6\u4f1a\u5c06 `host->free_string` \u5206\u6d3e\u5230\u9519\u8bef\u7684\u4e3b\u673a\u8df3\u677f\uff0c`libc free()` \u5728\u4e00\u4e2a\u975e malloc \u6307\u9488\u4e0a\u4e2d\u6b62\uff0c\u4ece\u800c\u5bfc\u81f4\u4e3b\u673a\u5d29\u6e83\u3002\u6709\u5173\u56fa\u5b9a\u504f\u79fb\u91cf\u4ee5\u53ca\u8bb0\u5f55\u5728\u6848\u7684 v1..v6 \u6f14\u8fdb\uff0c\u8bf7\u53c2\u9605 `docs/plugins/HOST_API.md \u2192 Mirror Struct Audit` \u548c `docs/plugins/ABI_VERSIONS.md`\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The result was capped at 500 rows.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Ergebnis wurde auf 500 Zeilen begrenzt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The result was capped at 500 rows."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7ed3\u679c\u5df2\u9650\u5236\u4e3a 500 \u884c\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme Editor": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Theme-Editor"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e3b\u9898\u7f16\u8f91\u5668"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme ID or Link": {
      "comment": "Label for a section in the \"Import by ID\" sheet where the user can input a theme ID or a link to a theme.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Theme-ID oder Link"
          }
        },
