          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e3b\u9898 ID \u6216\u94fe\u63a5"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme shared": {
      "comment": "Message shown in a toast when a theme is successfully shared.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Theme geteilt"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e3b\u9898\u5df2\u5206\u4eab"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme uploaded": {
      "comment": "A success message displayed when a theme is successfully uploaded.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Theme hochgeladen"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e3b\u9898\u5df2\u4e0a\u4f20"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Themes": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Themes"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e3b\u9898"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Themes could not be loaded. Try reinstalling the built-in themes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Themes konnten nicht geladen werden. Versuche die eingebauten Themes neu zu installieren."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u65e0\u6cd5\u52a0\u8f7d\u4e3b\u9898\u3002\u5c1d\u8bd5\u91cd\u65b0\u5b89\u88c5\u5185\u7f6e\u4e3b\u9898\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These `.mcp.json` entries were malformed (no `command` and no `url`) and couldn't be imported:": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese `.mcp.json`-Eintr\u00e4ge waren fehlerhaft (kein `command` und keine `url`) und konnten nicht importiert werden:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8fd9\u4e9b `.mcp.json` \u6761\u76ee\u683c\u5f0f\u9519\u8bef\uff08\u65e2\u65e0 `command` \u4e5f\u65e0 `url`\uff09\uff0c\u65e0\u6cd5\u5bfc\u5165\uff1a"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These agents had no machine-readable schedule and were created disabled. Tap one to set a cron expression:": {
      "comment": "A message explaining that some agents need their schedules configured.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Agenten hatten keinen maschinenlesbaren Zeitplan und wurden deaktiviert erstellt. Tippe auf einen, um einen Cron-Ausdruck festzulegen:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8fd9\u4e9b\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u6ca1\u6709\u673a\u5668\u53ef\u8bfb\u7684\u8ba1\u5212\uff0c\u521b\u5efa\u65f6\u4e3a\u7981\u7528\u72b6\u6001\u3002\u70b9\u51fb\u5176\u4e2d\u4e00\u4e2a\u4ee5\u8bbe\u7f6e cron \u8868\u8fbe\u5f0f\uff1a"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These artifacts couldn't be installed:": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Artefakte konnten nicht installiert werden:"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "These artifacts couldn't be installed:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u65e0\u6cd5\u5b89\u88c5\u8fd9\u4e9b\u5de5\u4ef6\uff1a"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These instructions will be sent to the AI when the schedule runs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Anweisungen werden an die KI gesendet, wenn der Zeitplan ausgef\u00fchrt wird."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f53\u65f6\u95f4\u8868\u8fd0\u884c\u65f6\uff0c\u8fd9\u4e9b\u6307\u4ee4\u5c06\u88ab\u53d1\u9001\u5230\u4eba\u5de5\u667a\u80fd\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These models are no longer used. Delete to free up %@.": {
      "comment": "A paragraph explaining that the app will delete legacy WhisperKit models when the user taps \"Delete\".",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Modelle werden nicht mehr verwendet. L\u00f6schen, um %@ freizugeben."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8fd9\u4e9b\u6a21\u578b\u5df2\u4e0d\u518d\u4f7f\u7528\u3002\u5220\u9664\u53ef\u91ca\u653e %@\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These providers use OAuth and were created disabled. Tap one to open its editor and complete sign-in:": {
      "comment": "Notice displayed in the GitHub Import Sheet when some MCP providers need OAuth sign-in.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Anbieter verwenden OAuth und wurden deaktiviert erstellt. Tippe auf einen, um seinen Editor zu \u00f6ffnen und die Anmeldung abzuschlie\u00dfen:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8fd9\u4e9b\u63d0\u4f9b\u65b9\u4f7f\u7528 OAuth\uff0c\u521b\u5efa\u65f6\u4e3a\u7981\u7528\u72b6\u6001\u3002\u70b9\u51fb\u5176\u4e2d\u4e00\u4e2a\u4ee5\u6253\u5f00\u5176\u7f16\u8f91\u5668\u5e76\u5b8c\u6210\u767b\u5f55\uff1a"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These servers ship with placeholder credentials. Tap one to open its editor and paste a real token:": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Server werden mit Platzhalter-Anmeldedaten ausgeliefert. Tippe auf einen, um seinen Editor zu \u00f6ffnen und ein echtes Token einzuf\u00fcgen:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8fd9\u4e9b\u670d\u52a1\u5668\u9644\u5e26\u7684\u662f\u5360\u4f4d\u51ed\u636e\u3002\u70b9\u51fb\u5176\u4e2d\u4e00\u4e2a\u4ee5\u6253\u5f00\u5176\u7f16\u8f91\u5668\u5e76\u7c98\u8d34\u771f\u5b9e\u4ee4\u724c\uff1a"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These settings apply to all voice modes: Voice Input, Transcription, and VAD Mode.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Einstellungen gelten f\u00fcr alle Sprachmodi: Spracheingabe, Transkription und VAD-Modus."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8fd9\u4e9b\u8bbe\u7f6e\u9002\u7528\u4e8e\u6240\u6709\u8bed\u97f3\u6a21\u5f0f\uff1a\u8bed\u97f3\u8f93\u5165\u3001\u8f6c\u5f55\u548c VAD \u6a21\u5f0f\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These stdio MCP servers were imported into the Osaurus sandbox but ship with `${VAR}` placeholders for sensitive env vars. Tap one to open its editor:": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese stdio-MCP-Server wurden in die Osaurus-Sandbox importiert, werden aber mit `${VAR}`-Platzhaltern f\u00fcr sensible Umgebungsvariablen ausgeliefert. Tippe auf einen, um seinen Editor zu \u00f6ffnen:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8fd9\u4e9b stdio MCP \u670d\u52a1\u5668\u5df2\u5bfc\u5165 Osaurus \u6c99\u76d2\uff0c\u4f46\u5176\u654f\u611f\u73af\u5883\u53d8\u91cf\u5e26\u6709 `${VAR}` \u5360\u4f4d\u7b26\u3002\u70b9\u51fb\u5176\u4e2d\u4e00\u4e2a\u4ee5\u6253\u5f00\u5176\u7f16\u8f91\u5668\uff1a"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thinking": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Denkt nach"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u601d\u7ef4"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This agent has no memory tables yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Agent hat noch keine Speichertabellen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6b64\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u8fd8\u6ca1\u6709\u8bb0\u5fc6\u8868\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This agent's database is approaching its storage quota.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Datenbank dieses Agenten n\u00e4hert sich ihrem Speicherkontingent."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "This agent's database is approaching its storage quota."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6b64\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u7684\u6570\u636e\u5e93\u5373\u5c06\u8fbe\u5230\u5176\u5b58\u50a8\u914d\u989d\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This command has no template body.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Befehl hat keinen Vorlagentext."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6b64\u547d\u4ee4\u6ca1\u6709\u6a21\u677f\u6b63\u6587\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This deletes the on-disk model (~2.8 GB). The Privacy Filter stops detecting until you re-download it.": {
      "comment": "A message displayed in a confirmation alert when the user confirms they want to remove the Privacy Filter model.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dies l\u00f6scht das auf der Festplatte gespeicherte Modell (~2,8 GB). Der Datenschutzfilter erkennt nichts mehr, bis du es erneut herunterl\u00e4dst."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8fd9\u5c06\u5220\u9664\u78c1\u76d8\u4e0a\u7684\u6a21\u578b\uff08\u7ea6 2.8 GB\uff09\u3002\u5728\u4f60\u91cd\u65b0\u4e0b\u8f7d\u4e4b\u524d\uff0c\u9690\u79c1\u8fc7\u6ee4\u5668\u5c06\u505c\u6b62\u68c0\u6d4b\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This deletes your signature, every agent's derived address, and every access key. Onboarding will start over. The backup in your iCloud Keychain will also be removed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dies l\u00f6scht deine Signatur, die abgeleitete Adresse jedes Agenten und jeden Zugriffsschl\u00fcssel. Das Onboarding beginnt von vorne. Das Backup in deinem iCloud-Schl\u00fcsselbund wird ebenfalls entfernt."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8fd9\u5c06\u5220\u9664\u4f60\u7684\u7b7e\u540d\u3001\u6bcf\u4e2a\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u6d3e\u751f\u7684\u5730\u5740\u4ee5\u53ca\u6bcf\u4e2a\u8bbf\u95ee\u5bc6\u94a5\u3002\u521d\u59cb\u8bbe\u7f6e\u5c06\u91cd\u65b0\u5f00\u59cb\u3002\u4f60 iCloud \u94a5\u5319\u4e32\u4e2d\u7684\u5907\u4efd\u4e5f\u5c06\u88ab\u79fb\u9664\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This field is required": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses Feld ist erforderlich"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6b64\u5b57\u6bb5\u662f\u5fc5\u9700\u7684"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This invite expired %@.": {
      "comment": "Auto-extracted format-string key (Apple String.LocalizationValue canonical form).",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Einladung ist am %@ abgelaufen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This invite expired %@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6b64\u9080\u8bf7\u5df2\u4e8e %@ \u8fc7\u671f\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is how your agent will look in the grid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "So sieht dein Agent im Raster aus."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8fd9\u5c31\u662f\u4f60\u7684\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u5728\u7f51\u683c\u4e2d\u7684\u6837\u5b50\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is injected before the system prompt on each message": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dies wird vor dem System-Prompt bei jeder Nachricht eingef\u00fcgt"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8fd9\u662f\u5728\u6bcf\u6761\u6d88\u606f\u7684\u7cfb\u7edf\u63d0\u793a\u4e4b\u524d\u6ce8\u5165\u7684"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This model is outdated. Click to switch to a newer version.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses Modell ist veraltet. Klicke, um zu einer neueren Version zu wechseln."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8fd9\u79cd\u6a21\u5f0f\u5df2\u7ecf\u8fc7\u65f6\u4e86\u3002\u5355\u51fb\u53ef\u5207\u6362\u5230\u8f83\u65b0\u7248\u672c\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This plugin declared configuration options. Non-sensitive values are stored locally; sensitive ones are kept in the system Keychain.": {
      "comment": "A description below the list of user config",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses Plugin hat Konfigurationsoptionen deklariert. Nicht sensible Werte werden lokal gespeichert; sensible werden im System-Schl\u00fcsselbund aufbewahrt."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6b64\u63d2\u4ef6\u58f0\u660e\u4e86\u914d\u7f6e\u9009\u9879\u3002\u975e\u654f\u611f\u503c\u5b58\u50a8\u5728\u672c\u5730\uff1b\u654f\u611f\u503c\u4fdd\u5b58\u5728\u7cfb\u7edf\u94a5\u5319\u4e32\u4e2d\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This plugin declared options you can configure (%lld field(s)).": {
      "comment": "A description of the benefits of configuring a plugin.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses Plugin hat Optionen deklariert, die du konfigurieren kannst (%lld Feld(er))."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6b64\u63d2\u4ef6\u58f0\u660e\u4e86\u4f60\u53ef\u4ee5\u914d\u7f6e\u7684\u9009\u9879\uff08%lld \u4e2a\u5b57\u6bb5\uff09\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This plugin declared: %@. Osaurus stores the metadata but does not yet execute these surfaces.": {
      "comment": "A paragraph explaining that some features of a plugin are not yet supported by Osaurus. The content inside the parentheses is a list of feature names separated by commas.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses Plugin hat deklariert: %@. Osaurus speichert die Metadaten, f\u00fchrt diese Oberfl\u00e4chen aber noch nicht aus."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6b64\u63d2\u4ef6\u58f0\u660e\u4e86\uff1a%@\u3002Osaurus \u4f1a\u5b58\u50a8\u5176\u5143\u6570\u636e\uff0c\u4f46\u5c1a\u672a\u6267\u884c\u8fd9\u4e9b\u63a5\u53e3\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This plugin isn't in the bundled catalog yet. Install to import its skills, agents, commands, and MCP servers, or open the homepage to learn more.": {
      "comment": "A message displayed when the marketplace catalog does not yet classify a plugin.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses Plugin ist noch nicht im mitgelieferten Katalog. Installiere es, um seine Skills, Agenten, Befehle und MCP-Server zu importieren, oder \u00f6ffne die Startseite, um mehr zu erfahren."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6b64\u63d2\u4ef6\u5c1a\u672a\u6536\u5f55\u5728\u5185\u7f6e\u76ee\u5f55\u4e2d\u3002\u5b89\u88c5\u5373\u53ef\u5bfc\u5165\u5176\u6280\u80fd\u3001\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u3001\u547d\u4ee4\u548c MCP \u670d\u52a1\u5668\uff0c\u6216\u6253\u5f00\u4e3b\u9875\u4ee5\u4e86\u89e3\u66f4\u591a\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This plugin needs your approval before it can load.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses Plugin ben\u00f6tigt deine Genehmigung, bevor es geladen werden kann."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8be5\u63d2\u4ef6\u9700\u8981\u60a8\u7684\u6279\u51c6\u624d\u80fd\u52a0\u8f7d\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This plugin requires credentials to function properly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses Plugin ben\u00f6tigt Zugangsdaten, um richtig zu funktionieren."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8be5\u63d2\u4ef6\u9700\u8981\u51ed\u636e\u624d\u80fd\u6b63\u5e38\u8fd0\u884c\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This plugin requires credentials to function. Your secrets are stored securely in the system Keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses Plugin ben\u00f6tigt Anmeldedaten, um zu funktionieren. Deine Geheimnisse werden sicher im System-Schl\u00fcsselbund gespeichert."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6b64\u63d2\u4ef6\u9700\u8981\u51ed\u636e\u624d\u80fd\u8fd0\u884c\u3002\u4f60\u7684\u5bc6\u94a5\u4f1a\u5b89\u5168\u5730\u5b58\u50a8\u5728\u7cfb\u7edf\u94a5\u5319\u4e32\u4e2d\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This remote agent is no longer available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Remote-Agent ist nicht mehr verf\u00fcgbar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6b64\u8fdc\u7a0b\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u5df2\u4e0d\u518d\u53ef\u7528\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This repo did not pass the MLX-compatible metadata/file check. Use an MLX, MXFP, JANG, JANGTQ, or TurboQuant repo with config, tokenizer, and model weights.": {
      "comment": "Error message displayed in the Hugging Face import sheet when a repo is found that is not MLX-compatible.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses Repo hat die MLX-kompatible Metadaten-/Dateipr\u00fcfung nicht bestanden. Verwende ein MLX-, MXFP-, JANG-, JANGTQ- oder TurboQuant-Repo mit Konfiguration, Tokenizer und Modellgewichten."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6b64\u4ed3\u5e93\u672a\u901a\u8fc7 MLX \u517c\u5bb9\u6027\u5143\u6570\u636e/\u6587\u4ef6\u68c0\u67e5\u3002\u8bf7\u4f7f\u7528\u5305\u542b\u914d\u7f6e\u3001\u5206\u8bcd\u5668\u548c\u6a21\u578b\u6743\u91cd\u7684 MLX\u3001MXFP\u3001JANG\u3001JANGTQ \u6216 TurboQuant \u4ed3\u5e93\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This server doesn't require authentication.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Server erfordert keine Authentifizierung."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6b64\u670d\u52a1\u5668\u4e0d\u9700\u8981\u8eab\u4efd\u9a8c\u8bc1\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This server rejected the request as unauthorized. Paste an API token to retry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Server hat die Anfrage als nicht autorisiert abgelehnt. F\u00fcge ein API-Token ein, um es erneut zu versuchen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "This server rejected the request as unauthorized. Paste an API token to retry."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6b64\u670d\u52a1\u5668\u4ee5\u672a\u6388\u6743\u4e3a\u7531\u62d2\u7edd\u4e86\u8be5\u8bf7\u6c42\u3002\u8bf7\u7c98\u8d34 API \u4ee4\u724c\u4ee5\u91cd\u8bd5\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This server requires OAuth sign in to provide tools.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Server erfordert eine OAuth-Anmeldung, um Tools bereitzustellen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6b64\u670d\u52a1\u5668\u9700\u8981 OAuth \u767b\u5f55\u624d\u80fd\u63d0\u4f9b\u5de5\u5177\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This text is inserted into the chat input when you select the command. You continue typing after it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Text wird in die Chat-Eingabe eingef\u00fcgt, wenn du den Befehl ausw\u00e4hlst. Du tippst danach weiter."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f53\u4f60\u9009\u62e9\u8be5\u547d\u4ee4\u65f6\uff0c\u8fd9\u6bb5\u6587\u672c\u4f1a\u88ab\u63d2\u5165\u5230\u804a\u5929\u8f93\u5165\u6846\u4e2d\u3002\u4f60\u53ef\u4ee5\u5728\u5176\u540e\u7ee7\u7eed\u8f93\u5165\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This value is stored securely": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Wert wird sicher gespeichert"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "This value is stored securely"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6b64\u503c\u5df2\u5b89\u5168\u5b58\u50a8"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will create a public URL for this agent via agent.osaurus.ai. Anyone with the URL can send requests to your local server. Your access keys still protect the API endpoints.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dadurch wird \u00fcber agent.osaurus.ai eine \u00f6ffentliche URL f\u00fcr diesen Agenten erstellt. Jeder mit der URL kann Anfragen an deinen lokalen Server senden. Deine Zugriffsschl\u00fcssel sch\u00fctzen die API-Endpunkte weiterhin."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8fd9\u5c06\u901a\u8fc7 agent.osaurus.ai \u4e3a\u6b64\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u521b\u5efa\u4e00\u4e2a\u516c\u5f00 URL\u3002\u4efb\u4f55\u62e5\u6709\u8be5 URL \u7684\u4eba\u90fd\u53ef\u4ee5\u5411\u4f60\u7684\u672c\u5730\u670d\u52a1\u5668\u53d1\u9001\u8bf7\u6c42\u3002\u4f60\u7684\u8bbf\u95ee\u5bc6\u94a5\u4ecd\u4f1a\u4fdd\u62a4 API \u7aef\u70b9\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will cryptographically verify both devices. The remote device will show an approval prompt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dadurch werden beide Ger\u00e4te kryptografisch verifiziert. Das Remote-Ger\u00e4t zeigt eine Genehmigungsaufforderung an."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8fd9\u5c06\u5bf9\u4e24\u53f0\u8bbe\u5907\u8fdb\u884c\u52a0\u5bc6\u9a8c\u8bc1\u3002\u8fdc\u7a0b\u8bbe\u5907\u4f1a\u663e\u793a\u4e00\u4e2a\u6279\u51c6\u63d0\u793a\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will destroy the container and re-provision from scratch. Installed packages and sandbox plugin state will be lost.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dadurch wird der Container zerst\u00f6rt und von Grund auf neu bereitgestellt. Installierte Pakete und der Sandbox-Plugin-Zustand gehen verloren."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8fd9\u5c06\u9500\u6bc1\u5bb9\u5668\u5e76\u4ece\u5934\u91cd\u65b0\u914d\u7f6e\u3002\u5df2\u5b89\u88c5\u7684\u8f6f\u4ef6\u5305\u548c\u6c99\u76d2\u63d2\u4ef6\u72b6\u6001\u5c06\u4e22\u5931\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will permanently delete all your data, including chat history, agents, memory, and your identity keys. This action cannot be undone and the application will close.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dadurch werden alle deine Daten dauerhaft gel\u00f6scht, einschlie\u00dflich Chatverlauf, Agenten, Speicher und deiner Identit\u00e4tsschl\u00fcssel. Diese Aktion kann nicht r\u00fcckg\u00e4ngig gemacht werden, und die Anwendung wird geschlossen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "This will permanently delete all your data, including chat history, agents, memory, and your identity keys. This action cannot be undone and the application will close."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8fd9\u5c06\u6c38\u4e45\u5220\u9664\u4f60\u7684\u6240\u6709\u6570\u636e\uff0c\u5305\u62ec\u804a\u5929\u5386\u53f2\u3001\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u3001\u8bb0\u5fc6\u4ee5\u53ca\u4f60\u7684\u8eab\u4efd\u5bc6\u94a5\u3002\u6b64\u64cd\u4f5c\u65e0\u6cd5\u64a4\u9500\uff0c\u5e94\u7528\u5c06\u4f1a\u5173\u95ed\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will stop and remove the container entirely. You can set it up again later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dies stoppt und entfernt den Container vollst\u00e4ndig. Du kannst ihn sp\u00e4ter erneut einrichten."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
