    "We couldn't estimate memory needs for this model.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wir konnten den Speicherbedarf f\u00fcr dieses Modell nicht sch\u00e4tzen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "We couldn't estimate memory needs for this model."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4eec\u65e0\u6cd5\u4f30\u7b97\u6b64\u6a21\u578b\u7684\u5185\u5b58\u9700\u6c42\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We'll keep trying. You can also add tools later from Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wir versuchen es weiter. Du kannst Tools auch sp\u00e4ter \u00fcber die Einstellungen hinzuf\u00fcgen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4eec\u4f1a\u7ee7\u7eed\u5c1d\u8bd5\u3002\u4f60\u4e5f\u53ef\u4ee5\u7a0d\u540e\u4ece\u201c\u8bbe\u7f6e\u201d\u4e2d\u6dfb\u52a0\u5de5\u5177\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We'll open your browser to sign in. After approving, you'll be redirected back to Osaurus.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wir \u00f6ffnen deinen Browser zur Anmeldung. Nach der Genehmigung wirst du zur\u00fcck zu Osaurus weitergeleitet."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4eec\u5c06\u6253\u5f00\u4f60\u7684\u6d4f\u89c8\u5668\u4ee5\u8fdb\u884c\u767b\u5f55\u3002\u6279\u51c6\u540e\uff0c\u4f60\u5c06\u88ab\u91cd\u5b9a\u5411\u56de Osaurus\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We'll pick the most relevant ones from your enabled set each turn.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wir w\u00e4hlen bei jeder Runde die relevantesten aus deinem aktivierten Satz aus."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4eec\u4f1a\u5728\u6bcf\u4e00\u8f6e\u4ece\u4f60\u542f\u7528\u7684\u96c6\u5408\u4e2d\u6311\u9009\u6700\u76f8\u5173\u7684\u9879\u76ee\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We're keeping the one you already have so nothing you've built breaks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wir behalten die, die du bereits hast, damit nichts kaputtgeht, was du erstellt hast."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4eec\u4f1a\u4fdd\u7559\u4f60\u5df2\u6709\u7684\u90a3\u4e2a\uff0c\u8fd9\u6837\u4f60\u5df2\u6784\u5efa\u7684\u5185\u5bb9\u90fd\u4e0d\u4f1a\u53d7\u635f\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We're keeping the signature you have so nothing breaks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wir behalten deine vorhandene Signatur, damit nichts kaputtgeht."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4eec\u4f1a\u4fdd\u7559\u4f60\u73b0\u6709\u7684\u7b7e\u540d\uff0c\u8fd9\u6837\u4e0d\u4f1a\u6709\u4efb\u4f55\u4e1c\u897f\u51fa\u95ee\u9898\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weekly": {
