            "value": "Was ist derzeit in Osaurus konfiguriert?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Osaurus \u76ee\u524d\u914d\u7f6e\u4e86\u4ec0\u4e48\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's New in v%@": {
      "comment": "Auto-extracted format-string key (Apple String.LocalizationValue canonical form).",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neuigkeiten in v%@"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What's New in v%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "v%@ \u7684\u65b0\u529f\u80fd"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, Osaurus will continuously listen for agent names. Say a agent's name to automatically open a chat with that agent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiviert, h\u00f6rt Osaurus kontinuierlich auf Agentennamen. Sage den Namen eines Agenten, um automatisch einen Chat mit diesem Agenten zu \u00f6ffnen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u542f\u7528\u540e\uff0cOsaurus \u5c06\u6301\u7eed\u8046\u542c\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u7684\u540d\u79f0\u3002\u8bf4\u51fa\u67d0\u4e2a\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u7684\u540d\u79f0\u5373\u53ef\u81ea\u52a8\u6253\u5f00\u4e0e\u8be5\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u7684\u804a\u5929\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, press the hotkey to start transcribing. Your voice will be typed directly into the focused text field in any application.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiviert, dr\u00fccke das Tastenk\u00fcrzel, um mit der Transkription zu beginnen. Deine Stimme wird direkt in das fokussierte Textfeld jeder Anwendung getippt."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u542f\u7528\u540e\uff0c\u6309\u4e0b\u70ed\u952e\u5373\u53ef\u5f00\u59cb\u8f6c\u5f55\u3002\u4f60\u7684\u8bed\u97f3\u5c06\u88ab\u76f4\u63a5\u8f93\u5165\u5230\u4efb\u610f\u5e94\u7528\u4e2d\u5904\u4e8e\u7126\u70b9\u7684\u6587\u672c\u6846\u5185\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When off, Osaurus pins the BatchEngine to one active slot even if Concurrent Sessions is higher.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "When off, Osaurus pins the BatchEngine to one active slot even if Concurrent Sessions is higher."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f53\u6b64\u9009\u9879\u5173\u95ed\u65f6\uff0c\u5373\u4f7f\u5e76\u53d1\u4f1a\u8bdd\u6570\u8bbe\u7f6e\u5f97\u66f4\u9ad8\uff0cOsaurus \u4e5f\u4f1a\u5c06\u6279\u91cf\u5f15\u64ce\u56fa\u5b9a\u4e3a\u4e00\u4e2a\u6d3b\u52a8\u69fd\u4f4d\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When to evict a loaded model from RAM, and how long to keep it warm after the last request.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "When to evict a loaded model from RAM, and how long to keep it warm after the last request."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f55\u65f6\u5c06\u5df2\u52a0\u8f7d\u6a21\u578b\u4ece\u5185\u5b58\u4e2d\u9a71\u9010\uff0c\u4ee5\u53ca\u5728\u6700\u540e\u4e00\u6b21\u8bf7\u6c42\u540e\u4fdd\u6e29\u591a\u4e45\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When your dino installs packages, runs scripts, or fiddles with files, it does that in a tiny, walled-off workspace \u2014 separate from your Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn dein Dino Pakete installiert, Skripte ausf\u00fchrt oder an Dateien herumbastelt, tut er das in einem winzigen, abgeschotteten Arbeitsbereich \u2013 getrennt von deinem Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f53\u4f60\u7684\u5c0f\u6050\u9f99\u5b89\u88c5\u8f6f\u4ef6\u5305\u3001\u8fd0\u884c\u811a\u672c\u6216\u6446\u5f04\u6587\u4ef6\u65f6\uff0c\u5b83\u4f1a\u5728\u4e00\u4e2a\u5fae\u5c0f\u7684\u3001\u4e0e\u5916\u754c\u9694\u79bb\u7684\u5de5\u4f5c\u533a\u4e2d\u5b8c\u6210\u2014\u2014\u4e0e\u4f60\u7684 Mac \u76f8\u5206\u79bb\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where do I get my key?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wo bekomme ich meinen Schl\u00fcssel?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5728\u54ea\u91cc\u83b7\u53d6\u6211\u7684\u5bc6\u94a5\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where Osaurus listens for client requests. Changes restart the server.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Where Osaurus listens for client requests. Changes restart the server."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Osaurus\u76d1\u542c\u5ba2\u6237\u7aef\u8bf7\u6c42\u7684\u5730\u65b9\u3002\u66f4\u6539\u540e\u9700\u8981\u91cd\u542f\u670d\u52a1\u5668\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where toasts appear on screen": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Where toasts appear on screen"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toast \u5728\u5c4f\u5e55\u4e0a\u7684\u663e\u793a\u4f4d\u7f6e"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where your dino runs anything that touches your system.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wo dein Dino alles ausf\u00fchrt, was dein System ber\u00fchrt."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u7684\u5c0f\u6050\u9f99\u5728\u8fd9\u91cc\u8fd0\u884c\u4efb\u4f55\u4f1a\u63a5\u89e6\u5230\u4f60\u7cfb\u7edf\u7684\u5185\u5bb9\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who can call your API and how aggressively.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Who can call your API and how aggressively."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8c01\u53ef\u4ee5\u8c03\u7528\u60a8\u7684API\u4ee5\u53ca\u8c03\u7528\u7684\u9891\u7387\u3002"
          }
        }
