            "value": "\u5c06\u4f1a\u6bd4\u8f83\u52c9\u5f3a"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Will be saved when you accept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wird gespeichert, wenn du annimmst."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5c06\u5728\u4f60\u63a5\u53d7\u65f6\u4fdd\u5b58\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wipes your signature, every agent address, and every access key, including the backup in your iCloud Keychain. Onboarding will start over.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L\u00f6scht deine Signatur, jede Agentenadresse und jeden Zugriffsschl\u00fcssel, einschlie\u00dflich des Backups in deinem iCloud-Schl\u00fcsselbund. Das Onboarding beginnt von vorne."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6e05\u9664\u4f60\u7684\u7b7e\u540d\u3001\u6bcf\u4e2a\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u5730\u5740\u548c\u6bcf\u4e2a\u8bbf\u95ee\u5bc6\u94a5\uff0c\u5305\u62ec\u4f60 iCloud \u94a5\u5319\u4e32\u4e2d\u7684\u5907\u4efd\u3002\u521d\u59cb\u8bbe\u7f6e\u5c06\u91cd\u65b0\u5f00\u59cb\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wiping the macOS Keychain or migrating to a new Mac without iCloud Keychain sync makes encrypted storage unrecoverable. Take a plaintext backup first if you need to migrate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das L\u00f6schen des macOS-Schl\u00fcsselbunds oder die Migration auf einen neuen Mac ohne iCloud-Schl\u00fcsselbund-Synchronisierung macht den verschl\u00fcsselten Speicher unwiederbringlich. Erstelle zuerst ein Klartext-Backup, falls du migrieren musst."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6e05\u9664 macOS \u94a5\u5319\u4e32\uff0c\u6216\u5728\u672a\u540c\u6b65 iCloud \u94a5\u5319\u4e32\u7684\u60c5\u51b5\u4e0b\u8fc1\u79fb\u5230\u65b0 Mac\uff0c\u4f1a\u4f7f\u52a0\u5bc6\u5b58\u50a8\u65e0\u6cd5\u6062\u590d\u3002\u5982\u679c\u4f60\u9700\u8981\u8fc1\u79fb\uff0c\u8bf7\u5148\u8fdb\u884c\u660e\u6587\u5907\u4efd\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With a working folder, allow reading .env / keys / credentials. Off by default to keep secrets out of the sandbox.": {
      "comment": "A description for a toggle that lets an agent read environment variables, API keys, or other sensitive information from the host machine.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erlaube bei vorhandenem Arbeitsordner das Lesen von .env / Schl\u00fcsseln / Anmeldedaten. Standardm\u00e4\u00dfig deaktiviert, um Geheimnisse aus der Sandbox herauszuhalten."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5728\u6709\u5de5\u4f5c\u6587\u4ef6\u5939\u65f6\uff0c\u5141\u8bb8\u8bfb\u53d6 .env / \u5bc6\u94a5 / \u51ed\u636e\u3002\u9ed8\u8ba4\u5173\u95ed\uff0c\u4ee5\u5c06\u5bc6\u94a5\u6392\u9664\u5728\u6c99\u76d2\u4e4b\u5916\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
